@BASE_URL = {{$dotenv BASE_URL}}
@email = {{$dotenv EMAIL}}
@password = {{$dotenv PASSWORD}}
@AOI_ID = 231604f751dbd8f32d0612cb47ac38d94b8e43e136ca0af84d53334b2dff07b7

### Login
# @name login
POST {{BASE_URL}}/api/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

###
@TOKEN = {{login.response.body.token}}


### Peltolista → kopioi pellon id-kenttä @AOI_ID:ksi
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/fields
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}


### 1. Hae yleinen + 2026 → 200 { general: {...}, season: { year: 2026, ... } }
###    (vanha muistiinpano näkyy nyt generalissa)
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/fields/{{AOI_ID}}/note?year=2026
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

### 2. Tallenna yleinen (ei year-parametria) → 200 { text, updatedAt }
PUT {{BASE_URL}}/api/fields/{{AOI_ID}}/note
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "text": "Pohjoisreunassa märkä kohta" }

### 3. Tallenna kausi 2026 → 200
PUT {{BASE_URL}}/api/fields/{{AOI_ID}}/note?year=2026
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "text": "1. niitto 2.7., lannoitettu 12.6." }

### 4. Päivitä kausi 2026 (upsert, ei uutta dokumenttia) → 200, updatedAt muuttuu
PUT {{BASE_URL}}/api/fields/{{AOI_ID}}/note?year=2026
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "text": "1. niitto 2.7., lannoitettu 12.6. ja 3.7." }

### 5. Tallenna kausi 2025 → 200
PUT {{BASE_URL}}/api/fields/{{AOI_ID}}/note?year=2025
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "text": "Kuiva alkukesä" }

### 6. Hae 2026 → general + season 2026 (ei 2025:tä)
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/fields/{{AOI_ID}}/note?year=2026
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

### 7. Hae 2025 → general + season 2025
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/fields/{{AOI_ID}}/note?year=2025
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

### 8. Liian vanha vuosi → 400 INVALID_YEAR
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/fields/{{AOI_ID}}/note?year=2019
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

### 9. Tuleva vuosi → 400 INVALID_YEAR
PUT {{BASE_URL}}/api/fields/{{AOI_ID}}/note?year=2030
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "text": "ei pitäisi tallentua" }

### 10. Väärä tyyppi → 400 NOTE_BAD_REQUEST
PUT {{BASE_URL}}/api/fields/{{AOI_ID}}/note
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "text": 123 }

### 11. Pelto ei käyttäjän listalla → 404 FIELD_NOT_FOUND
PUT {{BASE_URL}}/api/fields/olematon-hash/note?year=2026
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "text": "ei pitäisi tallentua" }

### 12. Ilman tokenia → 401
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/fields/{{AOI_ID}}/note?year=2026

### 13. Tyhjennä kausi 2025 → 200 { text: "", updatedAt: null }
PUT {{BASE_URL}}/api/fields/{{AOI_ID}}/note?year=2025
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "text": "   " }